  "id": "roasted-herb-chicken-and-potatoes",
  "name": "Roasted Herb Chicken and Potatoes",
  "subtitle": "A savory one-pan roast with herbs and tender potatoes",
  "description": "A whole chicken roasts over potatoes and onion seasoned with garlic, herbs, vinegar, oil, and soy sauce.",
